{
  "category": "商品与电商",
  "description": "电商主图、生活方式场景图、美食摄影",
  "presets": {
    "background": "Minimalist studio, soft gradient",
    "lighting": "Softbox overhead, sharp rim light on edges",
    "quality": "Commercial photography quality, hyper-realistic textures"
  },
  "template": {
    "type": "E-commerce Hero Image",
    "product": {
      "name": "{{product_name}}",
      "material": "{{material_description}}",
      "angle": "{{camera_angle}}"
    },
    "setting": {
      "background": "{{background}}",
      "lighting": "{{lighting}}"
    },
    "copywriting": {
      "badges": "ARRAY of badge strings",
      "slogan": "{{slogan}}"
    },
    "constraints": "{{quality_constraints}}"
  },
  "pitfalls": [
    "材质和光影是灵魂：必须堆叠材质关键词（磨砂/金属/丝绸）和灯光（轮廓光/侧光）",
    "文案只给核心1-2句（新品/限时/特价），字多了画面毁",
    "商品角度要明确（3/4侧/正面/俯拍），不同角度质感差异巨大",
    "食品摄影必须写明角度（flat lay俯拍/45°/侧面）+ 道具搭配"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "description": "降噪耳机电商主图",
